<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC>This is the requestSeed level used for ECU programming.
The Security Access Data Record is optional (consider using the newer 0x29 service).
CANdesc supports it as a callout to the application.
DCM supports it. 
Data-driven testers do not support it out of the box.</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
